Package: qiew
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bert Speckels <skrrytch@speckels.net>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bespex/Qiew
Recommends: marq, xaq, jayq, trisq, hyqe, cusq, dirq, maiqe
Description: all Qiew viewers in one go
 Installs every Qiew viewer (Markdown, XML, JSON, HTML, CSV, Mermaid, TSX/JSX,
 diffs) and keeps the set complete: a viewer added later arrives with the
 next upgrade. Any of them can be removed on its own.
 .
 qiew-setup makes the installed viewers the default apps for their files in
 one step, instead of each viewer asking on its first start.
